{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "root": {
    "type": "Grid",
    "props": {
      "columns": 12,
      "gap": 16
    },
    "children": [
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "quality_no_meta",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "No change stamps",
          "variant": "hero"
        },
        "visibleWhen": {
          "dataset": "view_state",
          "field": "has_change_meta",
          "truthy": false
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Markdown",
            "id": "quality_no_meta_md",
            "props": {
              "content": "This catalog carries no change stamps yet. They are read during the XML import — import the solution again to check their quality."
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "quality_filters",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "Filter"
        },
        "visibleWhen": {
          "dataset": "view_state",
          "field": "has_change_meta",
          "truthy": true
        },
        "data": {
          "dataset": "view_state"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Row",
            "props": {
              "gap": 16,
              "align": "center"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "Select",
                "id": "quality_file_select",
                "data": {
                  "dataset": "file_options"
                },
                "props": {
                  "param": "file",
                  "label": "File",
                  "emptyOptionLabel": "All files",
                  "resetParams": [
                    "page"
                  ],
                  "multiple": true
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "NavButton",
                "id": "quality_filters_reset",
                "props": {
                  "label": "Reset filters",
                  "variant": "link",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "navigate",
                    "args": {
                      "path": "/dashboard/change_quality"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "Markdown",
            "id": "quality_state_md",
            "props": {
              "content": "Data state **{{data_state}}** · imported **{{imported}}** — the export is {{gap_days}} days older than the import."
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "quality_integrity",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "Integrity",
          "subtitle": "Checks of the import — after a healthy import every value is 0. Click a value to list the objects."
        },
        "visibleWhen": {
          "dataset": "view_state",
          "field": "has_change_meta",
          "truthy": true
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "KPIStrip",
            "id": "quality_integrity_kpis",
            "data": {
              "dataset": "kpis"
            },
            "props": {
              "items": [
                {
                  "label": "Objects without stamp",
                  "field": "missing",
                  "format": "number",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "openDashboard",
                    "args": {
                      "id": "change_quality",
                      "params": {
                        "issue": "missing"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "label": "Unreadable times",
                  "field": "unreadable",
                  "format": "number",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "openDashboard",
                    "args": {
                      "id": "change_quality",
                      "params": {
                        "issue": "unreadable"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "label": "Duplicate stamps",
                  "field": "duplicate",
                  "format": "number",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "openDashboard",
                    "args": {
                      "id": "change_quality",
                      "params": {
                        "issue": "duplicate"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "label": "Stamps after the import",
                  "field": "future",
                  "format": "number",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "openDashboard",
                    "args": {
                      "id": "change_quality",
                      "params": {
                        "issue": "future"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "label": "Stamps without burst",
                  "field": "unassigned",
                  "format": "number",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "openDashboard",
                    "args": {
                      "id": "change_quality",
                      "params": {
                        "issue": "unassigned"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "quality_signals",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "Signals",
          "subtitle": "How far the stamps speak for the individual object. High values are no error, they limit what the change views can tell."
        },
        "visibleWhen": {
          "dataset": "view_state",
          "field": "has_change_meta",
          "truthy": true
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "KPIStrip",
            "id": "quality_signal_kpis",
            "data": {
              "dataset": "kpis"
            },
            "props": {
              "items": [
                {
                  "label": "In mass events",
                  "field": "mass",
                  "format": "number",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "openDashboard",
                    "args": {
                      "id": "change_quality",
                      "params": {
                        "issue": "mass"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "label": "Share in mass events (%)",
                  "field": "mass_pct",
                  "format": "number"
                },
                {
                  "label": "Technical authors",
                  "field": "technical",
                  "format": "number",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "openDashboard",
                    "args": {
                      "id": "change_quality",
                      "params": {
                        "issue": "technical"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "label": "Without account",
                  "field": "no_account",
                  "format": "number",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "openDashboard",
                    "args": {
                      "id": "change_quality",
                      "params": {
                        "issue": "no_account"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "label": "Counter 0",
                  "field": "zero_counter",
                  "format": "number",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "openDashboard",
                    "args": {
                      "id": "change_quality",
                      "params": {
                        "issue": "zero_counter"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "label": "Persons with several names",
                  "field": "spelling",
                  "format": "number",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "openDashboard",
                    "args": {
                      "id": "change_quality",
                      "params": {
                        "issue": "spelling"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "quality_findings",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "Affected objects"
        },
        "visibleWhen": {
          "dataset": "view_state",
          "field": "show_findings",
          "truthy": true
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Row",
            "props": {
              "gap": 16,
              "align": "center"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "Markdown",
                "id": "quality_findings_md",
                "props": {
                  "content": "Objects behind the chosen value, oldest stamp first."
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "NavButton",
                "id": "quality_findings_clear",
                "props": {
                  "label": "Close list",
                  "variant": "link",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "openDashboard",
                    "args": {
                      "id": "change_quality"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "Table",
            "id": "quality_findings_table",
            "data": {
              "dataset": "findings"
            },
            "props": {
              "density": "compact",
              "rowKey": "row_key",
              "pageParam": "page",
              "sortable": true,
              "sortParam": "sort",
              "searchable": false,
              "columns": [
                {
                  "field": "at",
                  "label": "Stamp",
                  "nowrap": true
                },
                {
                  "field": "type",
                  "label": "Type",
                  "nowrap": true
                },
                {
                  "field": "name",
                  "label": "Object"
                },
                {
                  "field": "file",
                  "label": "File",
                  "nowrap": true
                },
                {
                  "field": "person",
                  "label": "Person",
                  "nowrap": true
                },
                {
                  "field": "account",
                  "label": "Account",
                  "nowrap": true
                },
                {
                  "field": "modifications",
                  "label": "Saves",
                  "align": "right",
                  "format": "number",
                  "nowrap": true
                },
                {
                  "field": "marker",
                  "label": "Note",
                  "format": "badge",
                  "badgeTone": {
                    "Mass event": "warning",
                    "Technical author": "partial"
                  },
                  "nowrap": true
                }
              ],
              "onRowClick": {
                "action": "openObject",
                "args": {
                  "uuid": "{{uuid}}",
                  "file": "{{file}}",
                  "type": "{{type}}"
                }
              },
              "empty": {
                "message": "No objects for this value."
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "quality_spellings",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "Persons with several names"
        },
        "visibleWhen": {
          "dataset": "view_state",
          "field": "show_spellings",
          "truthy": true
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Row",
            "props": {
              "gap": 16,
              "align": "center"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "Markdown",
                "id": "quality_spellings_md",
                "props": {
                  "content": "User names of one person — merge the variants of one person in the author aliases on the settings page."
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "NavButton",
                "id": "quality_spellings_clear",
                "props": {
                  "label": "Close list",
                  "variant": "link",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "openDashboard",
                    "args": {
                      "id": "change_quality"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "Table",
            "id": "quality_spellings_table",
            "data": {
              "dataset": "spellings"
            },
            "props": {
              "density": "compact",
              "rowKey": "row_key",
              "searchable": false,
              "columns": [
                {
                  "field": "person",
                  "label": "Person",
                  "nowrap": true
                },
                {
                  "field": "spelling",
                  "label": "User name",
                  "nowrap": true
                },
                {
                  "field": "accounts",
                  "label": "Accounts"
                },
                {
                  "field": "stamps",
                  "label": "Stamps",
                  "align": "right",
                  "format": "number",
                  "nowrap": true
                },
                {
                  "field": "last_at",
                  "label": "Last stamp",
                  "nowrap": true
                }
              ],
              "empty": {
                "message": "No person writes under several names."
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "quality_files",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "Per file",
          "subtitle": "The data state of a file is its newest individual change by a developer; a file stamped only by mass events has none."
        },
        "visibleWhen": {
          "dataset": "view_state",
          "field": "has_change_meta",
          "truthy": true
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Table",
            "id": "quality_files_table",
            "data": {
              "dataset": "per_file"
            },
            "props": {
              "density": "compact",
              "rowKey": "file",
              "searchable": false,
              "columns": [
                {
                  "field": "file",
                  "label": "File",
                  "nowrap": true
                },
                {
                  "field": "stamps",
                  "label": "Stamps",
                  "align": "right",
                  "format": "number",
                  "nowrap": true
                },
                {
                  "field": "mass_pct",
                  "label": "In mass events (%)",
                  "align": "right",
                  "format": "number",
                  "nowrap": true
                },
                {
                  "field": "technical",
                  "label": "Technical authors",
                  "align": "right",
                  "format": "number",
                  "nowrap": true
                },
                {
                  "field": "no_account",
                  "label": "Without account",
                  "align": "right",
                  "format": "number",
                  "nowrap": true
                },
                {
                  "field": "zero_counter",
                  "label": "Counter 0",
                  "align": "right",
                  "format": "number",
                  "nowrap": true
                },
                {
                  "field": "issues",
                  "label": "Integrity issues",
                  "align": "right",
                  "format": "number",
                  "nowrap": true
                },
                {
                  "field": "data_state",
                  "label": "Data state",
                  "nowrap": true
                },
                {
                  "field": "imported",
                  "label": "Imported",
                  "nowrap": true
                }
              ],
              "onRowClick": {
                "action": "openDashboard",
                "args": {
                  "id": "change_quality",
                  "params": {
                    "file": "{{file}}"
                  }
                }
              },
              "empty": {
                "message": "No stamps for the chosen files."
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "quality_basis",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "Data basis"
        },
        "visibleWhen": {
          "dataset": "view_state",
          "field": "has_change_meta",
          "truthy": true
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Markdown",
            "id": "quality_basis_md",
            "props": {
              "content": "**Objects without stamp:** objects of the types that carry a stamp in the export (scripts, layouts, fields and 13 more) without a row in ObjectChangeMeta. **Unreadable times:** a timestamp text the import could not read. **Duplicate stamps:** two rows for one object (UUID and file). **Stamps after the import:** newer than the file's import plus one day — usually a wrong clock on an editing client. **Stamps without burst:** a readable stamp outside every burst.\n\n**In mass events:** stamps of a migration, a find & replace, a paste or a tool run; such a stamp says little about the individual object, and its age is unknown. **Technical authors:** the FileMaker Data Migration Tool, WebDirect sessions and authors marked technical in the aliases. **Without account:** the export names no signed-in account. **Counter 0:** the export reports no save since the object was created. **Persons with several names:** user names in different spelling, or author keys merged by the aliases. A history of changes across imports — and with it the check for stamps that change without a counter — is not part of the catalog."
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
